	(lib_symbols)
	(text_box "Main GSE Board Pad Side:\n- STM32 MCU\n- SD card & USB-C\n- 2x Temp sensors\n- 4x 4-wire PT/LC amps\n- 4x TC amps\n- CAN Bus for external DAQ comm\n- RS-485 for user-side comms\n- LoRa for user-side comms\n- 12V, 18A igniter\n- 2x 12V fan connectors\n- External valve control\n- External audio DAC output"
